ime and place to serve them. The release of a new game “Lords Mobile” was a great opportunity to test the potential of Universal App Campaign to promote their new game application; a Machine Learning-powered solution that creates highly customized and targeted ads across multiple platforms, all done automatically and with real-time optimization. Hypothesis Machine learning help apps businesses efficiently g Hypothesis Machine learning help apps businesses efficiently gain high-value users at scale. adobe:docid:photoshop:04d699b3-a5fd-117b-bcbf-c7ac850e9ff8 uuid:33e50703-4a80-6f45-a011-44b16adae9ff xmp.did:62d0acf1-1b26-4e41-af8e-9c264e25aa89 xmp.did:ad6a09c3-a9d1-48be-a2d3-713be85169ed proof:pdf saved xmp.iid:ad6a09c3-a9d1-48be-a2d3-713be85169ed 2018-06-20T16:29:15-04:00 Adobe Photoshop CC (Macintosh) / converted from image/png to application/vnd.adobe.photoshop derived converted from image/png to application/vnd.adobe.photoshop saved xmp.iid:d9f7851b-9f90-438c-8706-63355dbc8882 2018-06-20T16:29:15-04:00 Adobe Photoshop CC (Macintosh) / saved xmp.iid:62d0acf1-1b26-4e41-af8e-9c264e25aa89 2018-11-08T14:38:30-05:00 Adobe Illustrator CC 22.1 (Macintosh) / uuid:bbee6ecd-56f7-4c42-9137-80fd8ac37446 xmp.did:8d81906e-9ffe-472b-a08d-896b7a9f142f xmp.did:ad6a09c3-a9d1-48be-a2d3-713be85169ed proof:pdf 1 720000/10000 720000/10000 2 65535 1292 4224 1 True False 1200.000000 3584.020849 Points GoogleSans-Regular Google Sans Regular Open Type Version 1.023 False GoogleSans-Regular.ttf ProductSans-Regular Product Sans Regular Open Type Version 1.001;PS 1.000;hotconv 1.0.78;makeotf.lib2.5.61930; ttfautohint (v1.3) False ProductSans-Regular.ttf Roboto-Thin Roboto Thin TrueType Version 2.137; 2017 False Roboto-Thin.ttf Roboto-Light Roboto Light TrueType Version 2.137; 2017 False Roboto-Light.ttf Roboto-Regular Roboto Regular TrueType Version 2.137; 2017 False Roboto-Regular.ttf Roboto-Medium Roboto Medium TrueType Version 2.137; 2017 False Roboto-Medium.ttf Cyan Magenta Yellow Black De